# War Machine, Legacy of Iron: X is his power as the ability resolves, and a negative X counts as 0 (CR 107.1b). On turn 3
# his beginning-of-combat ability targets Memnite, and in response Bot2's Depower gives him -4/-0: he is -3/3 as it resolves,
# so Memnite gets +0/+0 and is still a 1/1, not -2/1.

